 "caption": "The cost new investors forget to budget for: vacancy.\n\nWhen a tenant moves out, the rent stops. On $2,000/month, one empty month = $2,000 gone, about 8% of the year. Then add cleaning, paint and repairs before the next tenant.\n\nMany investors budget 5 to 8% of rent for vacancy. Your market may differ.\n\nExample numbers for illustration.\n\n#realestateinvesting #realestateexplained #rentalproperty #vacancy #landlord",
